<resources>
    <!-- Persistent warning above the SSH key list, including empty and loading states. -->
    <string name="private_key_security_notice">系统备份不包含私钥。在卸载应用、清除应用数据或更换设备之前，请从密钥菜单中导出可导出的私钥。请妥善保管导出的文件，尤其是未设置密码短语的文件。受生物识别保护的密钥无法导出；在移除本应用前，请另行安排登录方式。</string>
    <!-- Settings toggle for backing up records that already contain only a public key, never private keys. -->
    <string name="private_key_security_backup_public_only_title">备份仅含公钥的密钥记录</string>
    <!-- Explains the limited scope of the public-only key backup toggle; private key exports remain separate. -->
    <string name="private_key_security_backup_public_only_summary">仅包含不含私钥的密钥记录。即使开启此选项也不会包含私钥；请在卸载应用、清除应用数据或更换设备前单独导出。</string>
</resources>
